{"schemaVersion":1,"id":347,"sections":[{"id":"806001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20555],"start":0,"count":39},{"id":"806001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20556],"start":39,"count":27}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:1","scriptId":20555,"text":"虽说是要培养全能型指挥官，但对于我这个陆战指挥来说欠缺的航空知识实在太多了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:2","scriptId":20555,"text":"如果马上就参加实战的话或许会全军覆没也说不定。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:3","scriptId":20555,"text":"为了防止这种情况，我特地请亚当斯长官为我安排了一批专用的训练对手……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:4","scriptId":20555,"text":"特别空勤队基地外围——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:5","scriptId":20555,"text":"“约定的时间已经过了，还没来吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:6","scriptId":20555,"text":"亚当斯看了看手表，无奈地摇了摇头，而我和佐伊她们则继续望着天空。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:7","scriptId":20555,"text":"“她们小队是这样的，时间观念淡薄——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:8","scriptId":20555,"text":"“哦？好像来了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:9","scriptId":20555,"text":"我指向天空的一角，原本还想说些什么的亚当斯也注意到了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:10","scriptId":20555,"text":"能看到15点方向的天空，正有一队航空钢舞姬朝着基地飞来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:11","scriptId":20555,"text":"“应该是她们了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:13","scriptId":20555,"text":"随着钢舞姬们的逐一降落，终于看清了她们的样貌。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:14","scriptId":20555,"text":"从年龄上看都是非常年轻的小姑娘。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:15","scriptId":20555,"text":"“这几位是？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:16","scriptId":20555,"text":"“这三位是我们特别空勤队的初始成员。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:17","scriptId":20555,"text":"“初始成员？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:18","scriptId":20555,"text":"“她们是第一批通过空钢的测试员，从试验阶段到参加正式作战，已经积累了不少经验。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1125,"speaker":"娜奥米·兰开斯特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:19","scriptId":20555,"text":"“你好，我是娜奥米，火鹰小队的队长，另外两位是我的队员。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1125,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:20","scriptId":20555,"text":"“我就不用介绍啦~反正之前都已经认识了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":1111,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:21","scriptId":20555,"text":"“很高兴又见面了，玛加丽塔。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1116,"speaker":"玛加丽塔·杰米多娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:22","scriptId":20555,"text":"“做长官的陪练可是责任重大啊~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:23","scriptId":20555,"text":"“还请手下留情。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1116,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1122,"speaker":"斯盖拉·波特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:24","scriptId":20555,"text":"“斯盖拉·波特曼，很高兴能与长官这样的军事精英共事。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1122,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:25","scriptId":20555,"text":"“哪里哪里，只是略懂些战略而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1122,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1122,"speaker":"斯盖拉·波特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:26","scriptId":20555,"text":"“长官谦虚了，我记得报导上说过，死水最优秀的指挥官就是您了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1122,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:27","scriptId":20555,"text":"“哦？看来我还是名人嘛？对了，那篇报导在哪儿，让我看看～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1122,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:29","scriptId":20555,"text":"另外一边——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":916,"speaker":"梅丽雅·马尔斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:30","scriptId":20555,"text":"“长官一看到新人就会得意忘形？”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":916,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:31","scriptId":20555,"text":"“是啊，只是被夸两句，他就那副德行了，你习惯就好了。”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":916,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:32","scriptId":20555,"text":"“哼哼，也就是不熟悉他的人才会被报导蒙蔽～”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":572,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":904,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:33","scriptId":20555,"text":"“仿佛看到了过去的自己……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":572,"right":904,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:34","scriptId":20555,"text":"“现在你也差不多吧，还是很崇拜长官来着～芙琳～”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":582,"right":904,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":901,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:35","scriptId":20555,"text":"“哪有，崇拜长官什么的……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":582,"right":901,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":916,"speaker":"梅丽雅·马尔斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:36","scriptId":20555,"text":"“空钢里面也有年龄挺小的孩子啊，感觉可以成为好朋友～”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":916,"right":901,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:37","scriptId":20555,"text":"“不是人人都像梅丽雅你啊～人小鬼大～”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":916,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:38","scriptId":20555,"text":"“你们少说点，对人家评头论足是很不礼貌的。”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:39","scriptId":20555,"text":"佩妮这么一说，细碎的讨论声很快便消失了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:41","scriptId":20555,"text":"“好了，那接下来就让她们小队和你们进行模拟练习吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-PROLOGUE:20555:42","scriptId":20555,"text":"“了解。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:1","scriptId":20556,"text":"一轮交锋过后，教练机小队身上已经布满了漆弹……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:2","scriptId":20556,"text":"虽然火鹰小队也被染到了一些颜色，但比起教练机小队还是要好上不少。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:3","scriptId":20556,"text":"“认输认输，根本不是对手啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:4","scriptId":20556,"text":"“要知道航空钢舞姬的数量是很少的，像你这样使用的话，估计一次任务就都要进修理厂了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:5","scriptId":20556,"text":"“呃……习惯了激进的打法，毕竟在陆地的时候大都是搞突然袭击，只要求快准狠。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:6","scriptId":20556,"text":"“呵呵，这套理论在空战中其实也有效，但你得先了解每位航空钢舞姬的特性。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:7","scriptId":20556,"text":"“嗯，空中的正面交锋感觉完全不得要领。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:9","scriptId":20556,"text":"于是第一轮模拟练习以火鹰小队的胜利而告终。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:10","scriptId":20556,"text":"“这长官是怎么回事？根本就是门外汉嘛……与其让他指指点点的，还不如我们自己独立作战。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1115,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1118,"speaker":"妮莉·斯托克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:11","scriptId":20556,"text":"“就是就是。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1115,"right":1118,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:12","scriptId":20556,"text":"“连我们的机型和作用都不知道就急着指挥的感觉，应该是新人吧~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1120,"right":1118,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:13","scriptId":20556,"text":"“还以为死水的指挥官是什么精英人物呢，弄了半天是个菜鸟。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1120,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:14","scriptId":20556,"text":"始祖鸟小队的队员产生了极大的不满，当然这也是情有可原的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1120,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:15","scriptId":20556,"text":"在人数优势的情况下反而被打败，怎么想都是指挥有问题。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1120,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:16","scriptId":20556,"text":"“对不起，这次失败是我的责任。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1115,"speaker":"利季娅·达诺娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:17","scriptId":20556,"text":"“知道自己的错还有救，不然我可真的很难把性命托付给你这样的指挥。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1115,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1120,"speaker":"黛兰·沃茨","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:18","scriptId":20556,"text":"“我觉得长官应该先从基础学起~毕竟陆战和空战的差别还是很大的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1120,"right":1115,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1118,"speaker":"妮莉·斯托克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:19","scriptId":20556,"text":"“打得那么烂可不是我的问题，飓风的特色都不了解就让我追击……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1120,"right":1118,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:20","scriptId":20556,"text":"“呃……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1118,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1126,"speaker":"阿比盖尔·麦克莱恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:21","scriptId":20556,"text":"“拥有对空优势的舞装和人力却还发挥成这样，长官还需要多练练。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:22","scriptId":20556,"text":"被始祖鸟小队狠狠地数落了一番。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1126,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:23","scriptId":20556,"text":"“虽然有些强人所难，但还请你拿出更多干劲啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:24","scriptId":20556,"text":"亚当斯拍了拍我的肩膀。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:25","scriptId":20556,"text":"“我知道了，我会努力的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:26","scriptId":20556,"text":"当初抱着空勤指挥也不会太难的轻松心态，现在让自己吃到了恶果。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:27","scriptId":20556,"text":"现在除了点头哈腰承认自己的错误以外，其他什么都做不了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"806001-EPILOGUE:20556:28","scriptId":20556,"text":"（看来要好好反省下。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":1111,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
